---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icons from '../components/Icons.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Service status & intake notice | NutritionColours"
  description="Community, patient intake, and telehealth features are currently unavailable pending clinical governance and privacy validation."
  noindex={true}
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
    { name: 'Service status', path: '/connect' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
      <ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
        <li><a href="/" class="font-bold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline">Home</a></li>
        <li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
        <li aria-current="page" class="font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-200">Service status</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <div class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-700/60 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/50 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-300">
      <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      Clinical Governance Notice
    </div>

    <h1 class="mt-4 text-fluid-hero font-black text-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-50 brand-font">
      Intake & community features are unavailable
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 border-l-4 border-amber-400 dark:border-amber-500 pl-5">
      NutritionColours does not currently operate an active patient portal, diagnostic intake questionnaire, telehealth appointment scheduler, or public community forum.
    </p>

    <!-- Governance Principles Box -->
    <section class="card-interactive mt-10 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-4" aria-labelledby="boundary-principles-heading">
      <h2 id="boundary-principles-heading" class="text-xl font-black text-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-100">
        Clinical Scope & Data Safeguard Principles
      </h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-3 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
        <li>
          <strong class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-200">Zero Diagnostic Ingestion:</strong> We do not collect medical histories, diagnostic laboratory panels, or symptoms to generate automated dietary recommendations.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-200">Patient Data Privacy:</strong> User registration and consultation modules will remain offline until end-to-end security architectures complying with India's DPDP Act and international health data standards are certified.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-200">No Telehealth Operations:</strong> Remote consulting channels remain in planned status and will only be activated when certified clinical practitioners and verifiable medical indemnity protocols are operational.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Medical Emergency Reminder -->
    <div class="mt-8 rounded-3xl border border-red-200 dark:border-red-900/60 bg-red-50/70 dark:bg-red-950/30 p-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-red-950 dark:text-red-200 space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-red-100 dark:bg-red-900/60 text-red-700 dark:text-red-300 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-800" aria-hidden="true">
          <Icons name="alert-triangle" size={16} />
        </span>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-red-950 dark:text-red-100">Acute Medical Emergency Notice</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="text-red-900 dark:text-red-200">
        If you or someone you know is experiencing acute symptoms, chest pain, difficulty breathing, allergic anaphylaxis, or sudden severe distress, call your local emergency service or proceed to an emergency room immediately.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm font-bold">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-900 dark:bg-emerald-700 px-5 py-3 text-white hover:bg-emerald-800 dark:hover:bg-emerald-800 transition-colors">
        Return to homepage
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 px-5 py-3 text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200 hover:border-emerald-600 transition-colors">
        Contact editorial desk
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
